WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.641
- I feel like Stephen and
I might not be friends

00:00:01.641 --> 00:00:03.034
after this video.

00:00:03.034 --> 00:00:05.031
- That's because you
suck at arts and craft,

00:00:05.031 --> 00:00:06.238
and I'm awesome.

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:10.394
(holiday music)

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.936
- [Voiceover] I think I
don't need the instructions.

00:00:12.936 --> 00:00:14.597
- I could do this for days.

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:17.219
- I feel like a child, but it's fun.

00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:18.160
- I'm already like done.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.578
You said this would take 40 minutes,

00:00:19.578 --> 00:00:20.728
I'm thinking five.

00:00:20.728 --> 00:00:22.273
- Now I don't know what I'm doing at all.

00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:24.362
- Nope, this is a disaster.

00:00:24.362 --> 00:00:26.126
- Agghhh.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:27.845
- Actually, I feel like
my girlfriend would enjoy

00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:29.631
if we were sitting here together doing it.

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:30.386
- Well, she's not!

00:00:30.386 --> 00:00:32.105
I can't be her Stephen!

00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:33.091
- Oh no.

00:00:33.091 --> 00:00:34.113
- That's what yours looks like!

00:00:34.113 --> 00:00:35.273
- No, mine is clean.

00:00:35.273 --> 00:00:36.844
- Mine looks pretty dope.

00:00:36.844 --> 00:00:37.849
- This looks like sugar.

00:00:37.849 --> 00:00:38.964
Okay, mine looks like crap.

00:00:38.964 --> 00:00:40.646
- I have to say, it
turned out really nice.

00:00:40.646 --> 00:00:41.726
- This reminds me of LeBron.

00:00:41.726 --> 00:00:43.584
He does this thing, the "power-toss."

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.453
(blows forcefully)

00:00:45.453 --> 00:00:47.169
- It looks like what it is,

00:00:47.169 --> 00:00:49.770
which is you rolled salt onto a mason jar.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.162
- [Voiceover] Ooh, mason jar lids.

00:00:52.162 --> 00:00:53.265
- I'm actually so excited.

00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:55.227
I've always loved hot glue guns.

00:00:55.227 --> 00:00:56.701
- Oh, that's garbage.

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.419
- It's like once I make one mistake,

00:00:58.419 --> 00:01:00.114
I'm like 'fuck it, I don't care anymore.'

00:01:00.114 --> 00:01:01.739
But I do, I want this to look nice.

00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:03.840
- I feel like this is taking
longer than it should.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.281
- This is really fucking hard.

00:01:05.281 --> 00:01:06.954
Who invented this stupid bullshit?

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:08.298
- I feel like the world's

00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:09.854
shittiest Martha Stewart right now.

00:01:09.854 --> 00:01:11.212
- How do reload this thing?

00:01:11.212 --> 00:01:12.513
- What is it with these things and twine?

00:01:12.513 --> 00:01:13.570
Why do they always wanna make us--

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:14.371
- What do twine do?

00:01:14.371 --> 00:01:15.393
- Ha, it's decent. Look.

00:01:15.393 --> 00:01:17.377
- I can't look right now, I'm too busy.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.447
- Sorry.

00:01:18.447 --> 00:01:19.803
- They're adorable!

00:01:19.803 --> 00:01:20.715
- They kind of are.

00:01:20.715 --> 00:01:21.656
- I screwed it up,

00:01:21.656 --> 00:01:22.956
but then I managed to
get it back on track.

00:01:22.956 --> 00:01:24.476
- Stephen's is ugly.

00:01:24.476 --> 00:01:27.867
- We are doing a 3D snowflake together.

00:01:27.867 --> 00:01:29.132
Because Christmas is all about

00:01:29.132 --> 00:01:30.455
getting along with each other.

00:01:30.455 --> 00:01:31.908
- I don't have a good
feeling about this craft.

00:01:31.908 --> 00:01:32.592
- What?

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.508
- I'm terrified.

00:01:33.508 --> 00:01:34.833
- How?
- This is--

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.911
- I cut the first pieces of paper wrong.

00:01:36.911 --> 00:01:37.816
- Disaster.

00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:39.487
- Had to get new pieces of paper.

00:01:39.487 --> 00:01:40.510
- Shameful.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:42.436
- And have Matt show me
the right way to cut.

00:01:42.436 --> 00:01:43.573
- Mmhmm, surprising.

00:01:43.573 --> 00:01:44.873
- Alright, alright, we can do this.

00:01:44.873 --> 00:01:47.555
- Ah, ahhh.

00:01:47.555 --> 00:01:48.602
- What are you doing, what?

00:01:48.602 --> 00:01:50.022
- I think buying IKEA furniture together

00:01:50.022 --> 00:01:51.102
is easier than this.

00:01:51.102 --> 00:01:51.961
(laughs)

00:01:51.961 --> 00:01:54.399
- This could be in a museum.

00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:56.302
- The shittiest, saddest museum.

00:01:56.302 --> 00:01:58.358
- I don't understand how
you can be bad at cutting.

00:01:58.358 --> 00:02:00.819
- You know, I don't understand
how you can be so mean

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:02.316
to someone so fuckin' cute.

00:02:02.316 --> 00:02:05.996
Okay, that's very mature Stephen.

00:02:05.996 --> 00:02:08.201
- Kind of looks like a
person, more than a snowflake.

00:02:08.201 --> 00:02:09.815
- It's like a snowflake dancer.

00:02:09.815 --> 00:02:12.844
- Maybe you can do it in like fast motion.

00:02:12.844 --> 00:02:14.958
- He's available for parties,
ladies and gentleman.

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:16.642
- It turned out even
better than we expected.

00:02:16.642 --> 00:02:18.858
- And this is like Picasso.

00:02:18.858 --> 00:02:21.122
- You know it's always fun to do crafts,

00:02:21.122 --> 00:02:23.873
but you forget how frustrating it is.

00:02:23.873 --> 00:02:25.161
- Kate messed up a lot.

00:02:25.161 --> 00:02:27.403
- I think it's cheaper,
and it means a lot more

00:02:27.403 --> 00:02:28.261
when you do it.

00:02:28.261 --> 00:02:30.212
- Stephen and I should do
Pinterest crafts every year.

00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:31.955
'Cause clearly it works out great.

00:02:31.955 --> 00:02:33.601
- You're welcome, America.

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:34.693
(laughs)

00:02:34.693 --> 00:02:37.457
- And God bless us, everyone.

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:38.559
- Merry Christmas!

00:02:38.719 --> 00:02:39.477
- Merry Christmas!

00:02:39.477 --> 00:02:41.281
- Thank you.

